            "verified_icon_color": "",
            "verified_text_color": "",
            "review_1_quote": "<p>\"I was diagnosed with breast cancer. Now my husband and I try to remove as many toxins as possible from our environment. Not only is this mattress comfortable, but knowing I am sleeping on toxin-free material is a beautiful thing. The peace of mind it brings to us is priceless. \"</p>",
            "review_1_author": "Laura S.",
            "review_1_rating": 5,
            "review_1_verified": true,
            "review_2_quote": "<p>\"First night was truly an amazing night! Been sleeping on a 20-year old mattress. And I definitely would recommend this to anyone looking for a new mattress.\"</p>",
            "review_2_author": "Marcello D.G.",
            "review_2_rating": 5,
            "review_2_verified": true,
            "review_3_quote": "<p>\"Incredible Mattress! I got two more for my kids, I think it is so important for our mind and body to be without harmful materials\"</p>",
