            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<ul><li>10\" handcrafted profile (±1\")</li><li>Hand-tufted construction for durability without adhesives</li><li>Certified organic cotton & wool comfort layers</li><li>Certified organic latex for responsive support</li><li>8\" individually pocketed coil system with targeted support</li><li>Adjustable base compatible</li><li>Assembled in the USA using domestic and globally sourced materials</li></ul>",
