        "show_play_icon": true,
        "poster": "shopify://shop_images/Frame_48101000.png",
        "overlay_text": "",
        "quote": "<p><em>\"I spent years helping people optimize their health, yet I overlooked the one place we spend nearly one-third of our lives. When I started testing for toxic load, I realized my mattress wasn't supporting the life I was trying to build. I couldn't find one that met my standards, so we created it.\"</em></p>",
